  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Thanks to your assistance, the transport route ",
      "became much safer. Now I'm going to buy requirements. ",
      "Fortunately, I have some Force Orbs to use when I am in ",
      "difficulties. Please stop by sometimes. Here is ",
      "the place where the combatants are training. ",
      "",
      "Force Orb is the item you can use on a battle and ",
      "it helps to mazimixe your attack power. ",
      "The Force Orb in your inventory can be activated ",
      "by right-clicking. Please make the best use of it.",
      "",
